    "description": "The National Map 1:1 million (grey) is a small-scale topographic map giving an overview of Central Europe: Switzerland and its neighbours from Lyons to Salzburg and from Strasbourg to Genoa on a handy overview map (Paris, Vienna, Frankfurt and Marseille on one sheet). The National Map 1:1 million (grey) is published in digital format as the Swiss Map Raster and is also available as WMS or WMTS geoservice.",
